WEBVTT

00:00.083 --> 00:03.294
Lately, I’ve been haunted by a recurring dream.

00:03.753 --> 00:06.464
Although I reluctantly call it that.

00:06.881 --> 00:10.385
What I experience is far too deliberate.

00:10.969 --> 00:14.431
»Visitation« seems a more fitting term; they won’t leave me alone.

00:14.764 --> 00:19.269
It’s as if they’ve returned, and there’s nowhere I can hide.

00:19.894 --> 00:26.735
Back then, I thought that if I shut my eyes for long enough, I would realise that they were just an illusion.

00:27.277 --> 00:36.327
Given how many times I moved their names between the registers, I convinced myself I was just seeing things.

00:36.619 --> 00:41.291
But every time I thought they had disappeared for good,

00:41.499 --> 00:45.545
I could hear the distinct sound of shuffling footsteps on the other side of the plexiglass partition,

00:46.004 --> 00:50.842
their faces materialising before me, if only for a second.

00:51.259 --> 00:54.679
I’m not sure how they kept coming back.

00:55.055 --> 01:01.394
I followed the procedure exactly as I had been instructed during training.

01:01.686 --> 01:03.813
I never missed a session.

01:04.189 --> 01:12.322
I did everything I was supposed to; almost obsessively, I compared the computerized records with the records we kept by hand.

01:12.614 --> 01:17.952
I was responsible for taking the minutes of the meetings, which we then forwarded on.

01:18.495 --> 01:21.915
I recorded everything down to the smallest detail.

01:22.332 --> 01:29.839
I even learnt certain passages by heart so that I could carry out the proceedings with absolute precision.

01:30.423 --> 01:35.261
I can still almost recite them all; they are constantly swirling around in my head.

01:37.639 --> 01:57.659
<i>»Where it is established that a person is not a citizen of the Republic of Slovenia (whether this is disclosed by the person themselves, following a negative decision on an application for Slovenian citizenship, or during administrative proceedings), that person must be instructed to regularise their status as an alien, after which they shall be removed from the register of permanent residents.</i>

01:58.535 --> 02:20.682
<i>Status changes shall be duly recorded in the computerised register and in all files maintained by the municipal administrative body for internal affairs. In the card-based register of permanent residents, the entry ‘Became an alien’ and the date on which the person’s status changed are entered in the ‘Official notes’ section of the personal file.</i>

02:21.266 --> 02:43.246
<i>The personal file is transferred to a separate file containing the records of persons who have been deprived of Slovenian citizenship. On the household card in the register of permanent residents, under the heading ‘Type of change’ for the household member who has changed their status, the entry ‘Became an alien’ and the date are entered, and the person is removed from the household card.</i>

02:43.913 --> 02:57.427
<i>If all family members become foreign nationals, this shall be entered, together with the date, in the ‘Official notes’ section, and the record shall be transferred to a special file of households that have moved away or ceased to exist.«</i>

02:58.803 --> 03:03.892
<i>»If the person has an identity card issued in the Republic of Slovenia, it shall be destroyed.</i>

03:03.892 --> 03:10.690
<i>The card relating to the issued identity card shall be removed from the file of issued identity cards and destroyed.«</i>

03:12.692 --> 03:19.032
Each time I wake up, it feels as though a hand is squeezing my heart.

03:19.407 --> 03:25.413
Its fingertips have extended into sharp claws that are slowly tearing through the tissue.

03:25.705 --> 03:31.336
I forget how to breathe, to the point where I nearly faint and sweat drips down my forehead.

03:31.461 --> 03:33.671
Then I realise that I have shouted.

03:34.130 --> 03:38.718
You might call this anxiety, but I know the hand is real.

03:39.219 --> 03:40.094
I recognise it.

03:40.720 --> 03:41.346
It’s mine.
